tags: linux-6.12-syscall-table

The file scripts/syscall.tbl of the source of Linux, at the release 6.12 (the tag v6.12 of the
repository of Linus Torvalds). The license of the file is GPL-2.0, so the repository
keeps a copy: contract/documents/linux-6.12-scripts-syscall.tbl.

